Z||000014||batboy||09-15-1999||08:53 PM||||To quote Ogre, "Check all the grounds!" The other possibility is that you have two wires shorting against each other. I've seen a blown fuse do weird things like that too. Man, I hate electrical problems, so time consuming to track down. Good luck.||||reg||1
